# Direct dependencies for api-service (intent / source of truth).
# Shared libraries (pydantic, psycopg, ...) are version-pinned centrally in
# ../constraints.txt. Regenerate the locked, hashed requirements.txt with:
#
#   uv pip compile api-service/requirements.in --generate-hashes \
#       -o api-service/requirements.txt
#
# (run inside a python:3.11-slim container so the lock matches the build image)
-c ../constraints.txt

